WEBVTT

00:00:07.894 --> 00:00:08.627
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.631 --> 00:00:11.042
<v><b>F:</b></v> I did it quickly.

00:00:13.031 --> 00:00:13.752
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:17.258
<v><b>M:</b></v> I went to bed at eight in the morning.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.035
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:21.043 --> 00:00:24.000
<v><b>F:</b></v> We often eat outside under an umbrella.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:26.813
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:27.855 --> 00:00:30.223
<v><b>M:</b></v> Wow! Look at the sky.

00:00:32.219 --> 00:00:33.066
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:36.033
<v><b>F:</b></v> It’s cold and raining.

00:00:38.022 --> 00:00:38.928
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:42.111
<v><b>M:</b></v> He studies eight hours a day.

00:00:44.111 --> 00:00:44.995
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.864
<v><b>F:</b></v> She gave us our tickets.

00:00:49.859 --> 00:00:50.566
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:51.559 --> 00:00:53.534
<v><b>M:</b></v> I love early mornings.